---
title = "Get the current time"
meta_title = "How to get the current time"
subtitle = "using the Gleam time package"
description = "The Gleam time package provides time functionality that works with Gleam on both Erlang and JavaScript"
tags = ["time"]
---

The `gleam_time` package provides time functionality that works on both the
Erlang and JavaScript targets. Add it as a dependency to your package:

```cli
gleam add gleam_time
```

Use the [`timestamp.system_time`](https://gleam-time.hexdocs.pm/gleam/time/timestamp.html#system_time)
to get the current time from the operating system.

```gleam
import gleam/time/timestamp.{type Timestamp}

pub fn now() -> Timestamp {
  timestamp.system_time()
}
```
